# ── Bluespec / bsc build output ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything a lab generates is rebuilt by `make`; none of it belongs here.
#
# Note what this file deliberately does NOT do: it does not ignore *.v, *.h,
# *.cxx or *.o at the top level.  Those extensions are generated by bsc, but a
# future lab may well ship a hand-written Verilog module or C header, and an
# ignore rule that silently swallows a source file is a bad trade.  Labs that
# generate into their own source directory carry their own .gitignore instead
# -- see lab0/smoke-bsc/.gitignore, which came from upstream along with the
# test it covers.  Everything else builds into one of the directories below.
*.bi
*.bo
*.ba
*.bexe
*.bexe.so
*.sched
*.info

build_bsim/
build_b/
build_v/
C_for_bsim/
verilog/
obj_dir*/
*_dir/

# ── Simulation output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.vcd
*.fsdb
log.txt

# ── Editor / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*~
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
__pycache__/
